* Variants written for the benches of the range control logic. None of these
* is a model of a manufacturer.

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
* The two comparators of one MCP6562 package (U31), each with its own
* offset, delay and hysteresis. It holds two of the comparator model of
* logic.lib and adds nothing to it: the shared model map gives both halves
* one parameter set, and a tolerance run needs an offset for each.
*   Pins in the order of the package: OUTA, INA-, INA+, VSS, INB+, INB-,
*   OUTB, VDD.
*   Every figure is that of the model MCP656X of logic.lib; this file names
*   no datasheet of its own. Parameters: delay, offset and hysteresis of
*   the first half (tda, vosa, vhya) and of the second (tdb, vosb, vhyb).
.subckt RL_MCP6562 outa inna inpa gnd inpb innb outb vdd
+ params: tda=47n tdb=47n vosa=0 vosb=0 vhya=3m vhyb=3m
XA inpa inna outa vdd gnd MCP656X td={tda} vhy={vhya} vos={vosa}
XB inpb innb outb vdd gnd MCP656X td={tdb} vhy={vhyb} vos={vosb}
.ends RL_MCP6562
